%description:

Tcp.maxRexmitTimeout:caps-rtt -- an RTO that the RTT makes larger than the maximum is the maximum.

The claim (Tcp.ned): "the upper limit of the retransmission timeout".

The class caps-rtt: TcpAlgorithmBase::rttMeasurementComplete() limits the RTO that it computes
from the RTT samples to the value; the class "caps" limits the backoff. This facet comes from the coverage gap loop: no test reached the code of this part. This test separates
"caps" from "free" (240 s).

Host under test: host1, without TLP (precondition), with a link delay of 220 ms: the RTT is
0.88 s, so the computed RTO is above 2 s. host1 sends 4344 bytes (3 segments) at 0.2 s, and the
tap drops the third segment the first time. Observation: level 1, the timer sends the third
segment again 2 s after the ACK of the first two segments.

%# parameter: Tcp.maxRexmitTimeout
%# class: caps-rtt
%# value: 2s
%# key: *.host1.tcp.maxRexmitTimeout
%# expected-result: PASS

%includes:
#include "ProtocolTest.h"

%global:

using namespace inet;
using namespace inet::protocoltest;

Define_ProtocolTestProgram()
{
    return ProtocolTest("TcpMaxRexmitTimeoutCapsRtt")
        .intercept(tap("tap").from("host1").filterPacket("tcp.sequenceNo == {isn} + 1 + 2 * 1448 && ipv4.totalLengthField > 100B").nth(1).drop()
                     .describe("the third data segment of host1, the first time"))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.synBit == true && tcp.ackBit == false")
             .capture("isn", "tcp.sequenceNo")
             .describe("the SYN of host1")
             .within(0.5))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetReceivedFromLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.ackNo == {isn} + 1 + 2896")
             .describe("the ACK of the first two segments")
             .within(4.0))
        .never(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
              .filterPacket("tcp.sequenceNo == {isn} + 1 + 2896 && pk.dataLength > tcp.headerLength")
              .describe("an early retransmission of the third segment")
              .within(1.95))
        .once(on("host1.tcp").signal("packetSentToLower")
             .filterPacket("tcp.sequenceNo == {isn} + 1 + 2896 && pk.dataLength > tcp.headerLength")
             .describe("retransmission of the third segment")
             .within(0.1));
}

%activity:
EV << "TcpMaxRexmitTimeoutCapsRtt compiled\n";

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
*.host1.tcp.maxRexmitTimeout = 2s    # the parameter under test
*.linkDelay = 220ms
*.host1.tcp.tlpEnabled = false
*.host1.app[0].sendBytes = 4344B
include ../../parameter/ini/_bulk.ini
include ../../parameter/ini/_base.ini

%contains: stdout
PROTOCOLTEST TcpMaxRexmitTimeoutCapsRtt: PASS
